<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} jsonld={jsonld} navVariant="inner">
<section class="hero">
<div class="wrap">
<span class="eyebrow">Cluster — 48-hour response</span>
<h1>Furniture inspection &amp; supplier verification in Saharanpur</h1>
<p class="lead">North India's wood-carving centre. Carved furniture, turned components, and parts that feed factories nationwide. Full cluster guide publishing soon—every Qualis service is available here now, with 48-hour response.</p>
<div class="hero-ctas"><a class="btn btn-solid" href="/#book">Book an inspection</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/why-independent/">Why independent</a></div>
</div>
</section>
<section><div class="wrap"><div class="grid"><a class="card rv" href="/pre-shipment-inspection-india/"><h3>Moisture &amp; grading</h3><p>Mixed timber sources and variable seasoning make core moisture readings essential on every order.</p></a><a class="card rv" href="/during-production-inspection/"><h3>Component consistency</h3><p>Turned and carved parts feeding assembly elsewhere — dimensional drift multiplies downstream.</p></a><a class="card rv" href="/supplier-verification-india/"><h3>Capacity claims</h3><p>Dense small-unit structure means big orders get distributed; verification maps who actually makes what.</p></a></div></div></section><section><div class="wrap prose-wrap"><p class="prose rv">Saharanpur supplies carved furniture and components across India and abroad. Because output flows through many small units, the inspection questions are consistency questions: same profile, same moisture, same finish across hundreds of hand-made parts.</p></div></section><section><div class="wrap"><div class="grid"><a class="card rv" href="/pre-shipment-inspection-india/"><h3>Pre-Shipment Inspection</h3><p>AQL 2.5, moisture, structure, finish vs golden sample — report in 24h.</p></a><a class="card rv" href="/supplier-verification-india/"><h3>Supplier Verification</h3><p>Unannounced premises visits, verdict in 3–5 working days.</p></a><a class="card rv" href="/factory-audit-india/"><h3>Factory Audit</h3><p>8-section scored audit for programme onboarding.</p></a><a class="card rv" href="/container-loading-supervision/"><h3>Container Loading Supervision</h3><p>Tally, dunnage, weather hold and photographed seal.</p></a></div></div></section>
<section class="final">
<div class="wrap">

<h2>Your next India order. Protected.</h2>
<p>Confirmed within 2 hours. Report within 24 hours of inspection. Paid by buyers only — never by factories.</p>
<a class="btn btn-solid" href="/#book">Book an inspection</a>
</div>
